IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. GOOD12 IS INITIAL.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 A PIC 9.
01 B PIC 9.
01 N PIC 9.
01 TBL.
   05 ROW PIC X OCCURS 1 TO 5 TIMES DEPENDING ON N.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    EVALUATE TRUE
    WHEN A = B
        DISPLAY "same"
    WHEN OTHER
    END-EVALUATE.
    EVALUATE FALSE
    WHEN A = B
    WHEN B = A
    END-EVALUATE.
    STOP RUN.
